@comment{
  Add your papers here in BibTeX format. The publications page is built from this file.
  Useful extra fields:
    selected    = {true}       shows the paper on the about page
    abbr        = {NeurIPS}    venue badge
    pdf         = {paper.pdf}  file in assets/pdf/
    arxiv       = {2401.00000}
    code        = {https://github.com/...}
    bibtex_show = {true}
    abstract    = {...}
  Your name is bolded automatically (see scholar.last_name / first_name in _config.yml).
}
